WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.220
Everyone says they can pay.

2
00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.990
The proof is always the same:

3
00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.530
show the whole wallet.

4
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.160
Proof of Funds asks for less.

5
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.910
Keep your money in a private Ring,

6
00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:11.570
and prove only a minimum.

7
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.480
A verifier checks that your notes are real and

8
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.580
unspent, signs one statement,

9
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.750
and keeps nothing.

10
00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.290
The chain records a certificate.

11
00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:22.190
At least a thousand SOL.

12
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.690
Not the amount.

13
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.990
Not the wallet, unless you choose it.

14
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.790
Move the money, and the certificate breaks.

15
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.750
On chain, for everyone, at that slot.

16
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.130
Post proof, not wallet.
